          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><br></div><div>iGenics® is a dietary supplement marketed for eye health and vision-related wellness. It is designed to complement a healthy lifestyle by providing nutritional support for people who want to take care of their eyes as they get older. The eyes are essential for everyday activities such as reading, working on digital screens, driving, and enjoying the world around us, making eye health an important part of overall well-being.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>As people age, maintaining healthy vision becomes increasingly important. Everyday habits such as spending long hours in front of screens, getting insufficient sleep, and following a diet that lacks essential nutrients may affect eye comfort and general visual wellness. A balanced diet, regular eye examinations, appropriate screen habits, and adequate rest are important foundations of a good eye-care routine.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Designed to Support Everyday Eye Wellness</b></div><div>\n</div><div>iGenics® is marketed as a nutritional option for individuals who want to add eye-health support to their daily routine. Depending on its verified formulation, an eye-health supplement may contain vitamins, minerals, or antioxidant compounds that contribute to normal eye function and help meet nutritional needs.</div><div><br></div><div>Certain nutrients, including vitamins A, C, and E, zinc, lutein, and zeaxanthin, are commonly associated with eye nutrition. However, these ingredients should not be attributed specifically to iGenics® unless they appear on its official Supplement Facts label.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Why Eye Nutrition Matters</b></div><div>The eyes rely on several nutrients to maintain normal function. Vitamin A, for example, contributes to the maintenance of normal vision, while certain antioxidants help protect cells against oxidative stress. Obtaining adequate nutrients through a varied, balanced diet is an important part of supporting long-term eye health.</div><div><br></div><div>A supplement such as iGenics® should complement, rather than replace, nutritious meals and professional eye care. Anyone experiencing blurred vision, sudden changes in sight, eye pain, or persistent visual discomfort should seek appropriate medical advice instead of relying on a supplement alone.</div><br><div><b>A Convenient Addition to Your Daily Routine</b></div><div>For people who prefer a straightforward wellness routine, a dietary supplement can be convenient to incorporate into everyday habits. If you choose to use iGenics®, follow the directions on its official label, check the ingredients carefully, and consult a healthcare professional if you take medication or have an existing medical condition.</div><br><div><b>Final Thoughts on iGenics®</b></div><div>iGenics® is positioned as an eye-health supplement for people interested in supporting their everyday vision and nutritional wellness. Its suitability and potential benefits depend on its actual ingredients, serving instructions, and individual nutritional needs. Maintaining a balanced diet, taking regular screen breaks, protecting your eyes from excessive sunlight, and scheduling routine eye examinations remain important parts of caring for your vision.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
