          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image1\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <a href=\"https://mwebzuno.com/11699/5627/7/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/money-back-guarantee.webp\" alt=\"VertiAid 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\"></a>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b><br></b><br><b><br></b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">iGenics® orders which are eligible will be covered by the 180 days money back guarantee policy which means that you get up to 6 months to test whether the formula for eye health and vision is right for your everyday needs.<br><br>Should there be any dissatisfaction with your order, please contact our customer support team during the applicable 180-day period and follow the procedures for making a refund request. Please make sure to have your order confirmation number handy in case we need it for your iGenics refund request.<br><br>The iGenics money back guarantee is meant to be a hassle-free option when testing out this eye supplement for yourself, while taking into consideration how it can work for you with proper nutrition, eye examinations and overall eye wellness regimen. Always check the details of the money back guarantee on the specific page from which you are buying from.<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
