              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 list2\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Items</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#838383\" name=\"border\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What is iGenics® and what is it used for?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">iGenics® is marketed as an eye-health dietary supplement designed to provide nutritional support for normal vision and overall eye wellness. Eye health depends on several nutrients, including vitamins, minerals, and antioxidant compounds that help maintain the normal function of eye tissues. Depending on the specific formulation, iGenics® may contain ingredients such as lutein, zeaxanthin, vitamins, minerals, and botanical extracts. These ingredients are intended to complement a balanced diet and healthy lifestyle. iGenics® should not be considered a treatment for eye diseases, a replacement for prescription glasses, or a substitute for regular eye examinations.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What are the potential benefits of iGenics®?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">iGenics® is designed to support everyday eye wellness through nutritional ingredients associated with normal visual function and antioxidant protection. Depending on its verified ingredient list, the formula may help provide nutrients involved in maintaining retinal health, protecting cells from oxidative stress, and supporting normal vision. For example, vitamin A contributes to normal vision, while lutein and zeaxanthin are carotenoids naturally present in the macula. However, the benefits depend on the actual ingredients and their amounts, and a supplement cannot guarantee sharper eyesight or reverse existing vision problems. A balanced diet, adequate sleep, UV-protective eyewear, and routine eye examinations remain important parts of maintaining healthy eyes.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>How should I take iGenics®?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">iGenics® should be taken according to the instructions printed on the current product label. The recommended serving, timing, and method of use may vary depending on the formulation, so it is important to follow the manufacturer's directions rather than guessing the dosage. Taking the supplement consistently as directed can help you incorporate it into your daily wellness routine. Do not exceed the recommended serving in an attempt to obtain faster results. If you already take other vitamin or mineral supplements, check their ingredient lists to avoid unnecessarily high combined doses. Consult a healthcare professional if you have questions about whether iGenics® is appropriate for you.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>How long does it take to notice results from iGenics®?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The time required to notice any effects can vary depending on a person's nutritional status, diet, general health, and the ingredients in the specific formula. Nutritional supplements are not instant solutions, and some people may not notice a clearly perceptible change at all. There is no reliable, universal timeframe in which iGenics® can be expected to improve vision. It is also important to understand that nutritional support does not necessarily correct refractive errors, eliminate the need for glasses, or treat eye conditions such as cataracts or glaucoma. If you experience blurred vision, persistent eye discomfort, or changes in your eyesight, arrange an examination with an eye-care professional.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is BurnBlend™ safe for everyone?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Dietary supplements may not be suitable for everyone. Anyone who is pregnant or breastfeeding, has an existing medical condition, or takes prescription or over-the-counter medications should consult a qualified healthcare professional before using BurnBlend™. It is also important to review the complete ingredient list and follow the product's recommended serving instructions. If an unexpected reaction occurs, discontinue use and seek appropriate medical advice.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "list2-10",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "uSyixu0mvQ",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "list2",
          "_sourceTheme": "tutorm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 32px",
                "margin": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 20px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "0 4px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "margin": "0",
              ".title-wrapper": {
                ".mbr-section-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "50px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "margin-bottom": "32px"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".panel-group": {
                ".card": {
                  "border-bottom": "1px solid @border",
                  "border-radius": "0 !important",
                  "&:first-child": {
                    "border-top": "1px solid @border"
                  },
                  ".card-header": {
                    "padding": "32px 0",
                    "border-bottom": "none",
                    "background-color": "transparent",
                    ".panel-title": {
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "space-between",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "&:not(.collapsed)": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "transform": "rotate(-45deg)"
                        }
                      },
                      ".panel-title-edit": {
                        "margin-bottom": "0"
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "24px",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-out"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  ".panel-collapse": {
                    ".panel-body": {
                      "margin-bottom": "50px",
                      "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                        "margin-bottom": "32px"
                      },
                      ".mbr-text": {
                        "margin-bottom": "50px",
                        "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                          "margin-bottom": "32px"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 list2\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Items</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#838383\" name=\"border\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is iGenics® safe for everyone?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">iGenics® may be suitable for some adults when used according to its label, but its suitability depends on the ingredients, dosages, medications, and individual health circumstances. People who are pregnant or breastfeeding, have an existing medical condition, or take prescription medications should consult a healthcare professional before using it. This is particularly important if the formula contains botanical extracts such as ginkgo biloba, which may interact with certain medications, including blood thinners. Avoid combining multiple supplements containing high doses of the same vitamins or minerals without professional guidance. Always review the full ingredient list, check for allergens, and discontinue use if an unexpected reaction occurs. iGenics® should complement, not replace, appropriate eye care.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is Audifort™ Worth Considering for Hearing Health?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Audifort™ may interest adults looking for a supplement marketed for general hearing wellness, but its value depends on the verified formula, product quality, price, and available scientific evidence. Consumers should avoid relying solely on promotional claims or testimonials when evaluating a supplement. A balanced diet, protection from excessive noise, and appropriate hearing evaluations are important parts of caring for hearing health. If you experience persistent ringing, difficulty understanding speech, ear pain, or changes in hearing, consult a healthcare professional. Sudden hearing loss requires urgent assessment. Audifort™ should be considered a supplement, not a replacement for proven medical care.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Can I take BurnBlend™ with other supplements or medications?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Because the exact formulation and ingredients can vary, it is important to check the current product label before combining BurnBlend™ with other supplements. If you take prescription medication, have a medical condition, or are unsure about potential ingredient interactions, speak with your doctor or pharmacist before use. Do not change or stop prescribed medication based on information about a dietary supplement.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What is the best way to take CogniCare Pro?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Just take 1 capsule every day before a meal with a half glass of water and you will love the results and see how you will feel.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What if CogniCare Pro doesn't work for me?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">I demand you are enthusiastic with your purchase, not just satisfied. And you won't know until you try it! So you can use CogniCare Pro for 90 days, with my \"No Questions Asked 100% Money Back Guarantee\". The only way to be totally convinced is to try this amazing formula and experience the results for yourself.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
